  "_readme": "GPU power library for TOA - Fan Control's true-load gauge. Maps desktop GPU model names to REFERENCE board power in watts (TDP/TGP/TBP as published by the vendor). Board-partner cards can run ~10-15% above reference - the gauge is honest-approximate, not lab-grade. Lookup rule: case-insensitive, longest key that appears in the sensor-reported card name wins. Card missing? Open a GitHub issue with your exact card name and it gets added.",
